          "text": "### Wayfinding readiness — July 25, 2025\n\nThe **Wayfinding Checklist** in the *NGH Main Campus Clinic Relocation Operations Workbook* contains **45 actual controls** (WF-001–WF-045), excluding headings, guidance, and other non-control lines.\n\n| Measure | Result |\n|---|---:|\n| Marked complete | **22** |\n| Remaining incomplete | **23** |\n| Completion rate | **48.9%** |\n| Critical-priority incomplete controls | **10** |\n\n**Currently blocked controls:**\n- **WF-028 — Endoscopy**\n- **WF-032 — Pulmonary**\n- **WF-036 — General Surgery**\n\nIncomplete includes controls marked In Progress, Not Started, or Blocked.",
